{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15332","headline":"早春雪夜寄卢纶兼呈秘书元丞 · 李端","name":"早春雪夜寄卢纶兼呈秘书元丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君随谢朓，春夜宿前川。\n看竹云垂地，寻僧月满田。\n熊寒方入树，鱼乐稍离船。\n独夜羇愁客，惟知惜故年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}